MODULE: PublishIgnoresRevision
TARGET: NoStalePublication
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: physical identity equality accepts a stale intent after ABA
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
        /\ running /\ phase[l] = "armed"
        /\ alias[l] = source[l] /\ version[l] = expected[l]
--- REPLACE
        /\ running /\ phase[l] = "armed"
        /\ alias[l] = source[l]
--- END
